{"chapter":{"blocks":[{"text":"写在最后","type":"TITLE"},{"text":"本节学习：写在最后。讲义保留原有示例与练习，可结合正文向教师提问。","type":"PARAGRAPH"},{"text":"网络是一个很棒的地方——你可以学到知识、找到朋友、看到全世界。但它也是一个需要小心的地方。记住这五句话：\n\n1. 不把隐私告诉陌生人。\n2. 网上说话也要有礼貌。\n3. 不点奇怪的链接。\n4. 遇到奇怪的事告诉大人。\n5. 控制好时间，多出门玩。\n\n做一个聪明、安全、有礼貌的小网友。","type":"MARKDOWN"}],"grade_max":3,"grade_min":1,"knowledge_points":[{"description":"学习并解释「写在最后」中的核心概念与示例。","name":"写在最后","slug":"primary-safety-topic-12","topic":"计算机与人工智能"}],"license_code":"UNKNOWN","objectives":["解释「写在最后」的主要概念，并结合示例完成文中练习。"],"order_index":24,"revision":1,"slug":"ch-012-lower","source":{"conversion":"supplied-markdown-v1","original_sha256":"fc2ac6b6aa1155c8f642a09130bc82f249ebf3666a8d83acb152dff844ed3373","source_commit":null,"source_path":"sources/fc2ac6b6aa1155c8/04-网络安全自助指南.md"},"stage":"PRIMARY_LOWER","title":"写在最后"},"content_hash":"fbddfddffa7e045127182a3e6cf8de36389b9c7c5c59c601a39644618ac9e16c","course":{"slug":"primary-safety","title":"儿童网络安全","topic":"计算机与人工智能"},"is_test_fixture":false,"manifest_hash":"b2500e5121455aa9339fe6399902e89a0917eaf9bd814708a6dc69af397b6b20","release_key":"computing-ai-md-v1-db6ffb6b663b","schema_version":"k12.content.revision-snapshot.v1","source_kind":"NEW_SOURCE"}
